+**Description:** The system SHALL run Exp 4363 as an offline, no-leaderboard active-data continuation over the two mechanic-limited E3 tails `tr87` and `ft09`, checkpointing `tr87` before `ft09` so bounded window exhaustion preserves the first game's record. It MUST first confirm that `environment_files/tr87/` and `environment_files/ft09/` are non-empty, that the executable-world-model harness, `arc_solver_kit.reproduce`, and `scripts/experiments/arc3_m2_active_data.py:active_collect` import, that TRM training is stood down, and that `scripts/research_conductor.py` is not modified; if either simulator is missing, the workflow MUST record `blocked_offline_env_missing_<game>` for that game and continue the other without leaderboard submission. For each available game it MUST collect a coverage-driven active dataset targeting the named residual actions (`tr87` actions 1/2/3/4 and `ft09` action 6), persist `active_transitions_collected`, print and persist per-game per-round verifier accuracy, preserve `results/arc_e3/<game>/world_model.py` as the induced deliverable path, and accept a level only when `arc_solver_kit.reproduce()` reports `reproduced=true` with `reached_level>=1`. If a bounded per-game round budget ends without a reproduced L1, it MUST write an honest per-game partial with the best verifier accuracy and residual mismatch class as a missing-world-model-rule gap in `ops/verifier_gaps.md`. The terminal artifact `results/experiment_4363_e3_mechanic_limited_tails_tr87_ft09.json` MUST include `honest_verdict`, `per_game_scorecard`, `world_model_paths`, `new_levels_reproduced`, `verifier_is_oracle`, `preconditions_checked`, `random_seed`, and `reproducibility_checksum`, with `new_levels_reproduced`, `verifier_is_oracle`, and `random_seed` emitted as bare values rather than principle-wrapped dictionaries. The artifact field principles SHALL be exactly: `honest_verdict` = `Terminal-prefixed (success_e3_tr87_ft09_<n>_reproduced or complete_e3_tr87_ft09_partial). Any reproduced L1 and an honest partial per game are BOTH progress.`; `per_game_scorecard` = `list of {game, verifier_accuracy, offline_reproduced, reproduced_levels, active_transitions_collected} -- the breadth-of-progress record for tr87/ft09.`; `world_model_paths` = `list[str]: results/arc_e3/{tr87,ft09}/world_model.py -- the induced models ARE the deliverables.`; `new_levels_reproduced` = `BARE int: NEW levels offline-reproduced across tr87+ft09 -- the incremental-progress unit.`; `verifier_is_oracle` = `BARE bool=true -- the SOLVEs are execution-grounded; ARC progress, NOT a moat headline.`; `preconditions_checked` = `Records the offline-env presence per game + active_collect import + TRM-stand-down; pre-empts the silent-missing-resource fabrication mode.`; `random_seed` = `Determinism precondition for the active collection + induction + exploration + planning.`; and `reproducibility_checksum` = `Hash of the active dataset + the world models + the plans + the reproduce() results; lets a third party re-run.`
